{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026jquQpIpOw41793353363.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>張與辰日前獲一眾粉絲（辰粉）特別包下開篷巴士，為他補祝生日。張與辰與粉絲一同乘坐開篷巴士穿梭於鬧市街道，眾人在車上邊欣賞沿途風景邊高歌，吸引不少路過途人揮手及叫好，場面熱鬧。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"a4e727a4-2071-4dc2-b993-0999d415a2f5.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026cZjq0t6wF11793353363.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>TVB娛樂新聞台</p></p><p>張與辰接受娛樂新聞台獨家訪問時表示，過去看到遊客乘坐開篷巴士觀光時，自己便一直希望能夠體驗，沒想到這次能圓夢，除了可以與粉絲一同聚會遊玩之外，亦能向街上途人送上歌聲，對此感到非常開心。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"391ed028-2011-47b8-b2ae-9589166ab700.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026aqIckAw7WF1793353363.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p><p>TVB娛樂新聞台</p></p><p></p><p>談及生日願望，張與辰表示希望身體健康，因為擁有健康的身體才可以完成更多工作。至於現場粉絲希望他能早日登上紅館開演唱會，張與辰回應指，紅館是每位歌手的終極目標，但對於能否登館則保持順其自然的態度。</p><h3></h3></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:17.071973+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":296,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T13:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:58:18.697157+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:48.589988+00:00","content_hash":"4aa72fca9b6b949ee210310a84c64ccacc10b38272eee8ee4e4f56baf342c6fa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:17.071973+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}